From: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: qcom-ipq9574: defer initial MPPE outband SGMII until media link

IPQ5332 with QCA8081 can enter an unrecoverable bidirectional packet
blackhole when the first copper PHY status poll sees link down,
although subsequent PCS and PHY link statuses report up, PCS PLL
lock/calibration are good, PHY receives copper frames, and MAC
transmits frames. The same image works if copper link is already up
when host UNIPHY configures its SGMII mode.

For MPPE index0 out-of-band SGMII, delay only the initial mode
configuration until the first PHY link-up callback, prior to MAC
link-up. Run the existing PCS mode and force-mode setup once, then
perform the usual speed programming and adapter reset.

This is a mechanism-driven A/B; not validated on hardware yet.
The previously tested full PCS reinit AFTER a broken first-link path
is a different operation and was unsuccessful.

Signed-off-by: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-qcom-ipq9574.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-qcom-ipq9574.c
@@ -580,6 +580,20 @@ static int ipq_pcs_config_sgmii(struct i
 {
 	int ret;
 
+	/*
+	 * On MPPE with an external out-of-band SGMII PHY, media link may
+	 * still be down when phylink first configures the PCS. Calibrating
+	 * UNIPHY before the PHY has enabled its serial datapath can leave
+	 * the two interfaces unable to exchange frames after copper links.
+	 * Defer the FIRST calibration until pcs_link_up(), which is called
+	 * before mac_link_up() with a known-good PHY media link.
+	 */
+	if (qpcs->mppe && index == 0 &&
+	    neg_mode == PHYLINK_PCS_NEG_OUTBAND &&
+	    interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_SGMII &&
+	    qpcs->interface != interface)
+		return 0;
+
 	/* Configure the PCS mode if required */
 	if (qpcs->interface != interface) {
 		ret = ipq_pcs_config_mode(qpcs, interface);
@@ -985,6 +999,29 @@ static void ipq_pcs_link_up(struct phyli
 			 speed, duplex, neg_mode);
 	}
 
+	/*
+	 * Complete deferred first-time out-of-band MPPE SGMII setup only
+	 * after the external copper PHY has established its media link.
+	 */
+	if (qpcs->mppe && index == 0 &&
+	    neg_mode == PHYLINK_PCS_NEG_OUTBAND &&
+	    interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_SGMII &&
+	    qpcs->interface != interface) {
+		ret = ipq_pcs_config_mode(qpcs, interface);
+		if (ret) {
+			dev_err(qpcs->dev, "Deferred SGMII mode setup failed: %d\n", ret);
+			return;
+		}
+
+		ret = ipq_pcs_config_sgmii(qpcs, index, neg_mode, interface);
+		if (ret) {
+			dev_err(qpcs->dev, "Deferred SGMII force mode failed: %d\n", ret);
+			return;
+		}
+
+		dev_info(qpcs->dev, "wave7-diag: first-media SGMII mode ready\n");
+	}
+
 	switch (interface) {
 	case PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_SGMII:
 	case PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_QSGMII:
